{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-task-notification#card-zh","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-task-notification","commit":"f10cd6869b7a50e55780627a6d55bbb310fd59b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Task Notification（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在一轮任务结束时由 DSH Host 发送系统桌面通知。插件接入 session/event 事件，记录 turn/start 时间和本轮用户输入，并在 turn/end 时计算耗时、识别完成、异常、中止或等待处理状态。通知展示任务摘要、状态、用时、系统声音和插件内置图标；过长任务文本会压缩，空文本则使用默认标题。它适合希望在任务运行结束后从桌面获知结果的 DSH Web 用户。需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本以及可用的桌面通知环境，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:69-111","index.js:24-58","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-task-notification#card-en","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-task-notification","commit":"f10cd6869b7a50e55780627a6d55bbb310fd59b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Native Task Notification sends desktop alerts when a Web client task turn ends. It listens for session events and displays the task summary, end status, elapsed time, system sound, and bundled icon. Long text is shortened. Requires Node.js 20+ and desktop notifications; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:69-111","index.js:24-58","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
