{"unit_id":"Cocowwy__dsh-plugin-task-notification#feature-1","repo":"Cocowwy/dsh-plugin-task-notification","commit":"f10cd6869b7a50e55780627a6d55bbb310fd59b4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Task Notification 的功能「任务结束桌面提醒」：每轮任务结束时发送原生系统通知，显示任务摘要、结束状态、耗时、声音和内置图标。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-58","index.js:90-108"]}
